SOLUTION 1
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    Na 50
SOLUTION 2
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    Cl 100
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file species.sel
    -temperature
    -totals Ca
    -molalities Ca+2 CaHCO3+ CaCO3 CaOH+
END
